Planner resolved Sam → 41fb-...:
`{"intent":"set_seeds","seed_node_ids":["41fb3423-..."],"node_ids":[],"importance_min":null,"time_mode":null,"time_from":null,"time_to":null,"message":"Focusing on Sam."}`

